Aim: Demonstrate hybrid inheritance using interfaces and a class.

Algorithm: Start
define interface
extend another interface
implement
call methods
stop.

Program:

interface Printable { void print(); }
interface Showable extends Printable { void show(); }
class Hybrid implements Showable {
    public void print(){System.out.println("Print");}
    public void show(){System.out.println("Show");}
}
class HybridDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Hybrid h=new Hybrid(); h.print(); h.show();
    }
}

Result: Print and Show

